  "text": "## Flights to Siargao under PHP 8,000\n\nSample one-way fares to Sayak Airport (IAO) in Del Carmen, cheapest first. These are not live prices.\n\n- **Cebu to Siargao** (CEB to IAO, direct, about 1h): PHP 2,980. Morning departure, 7 kg carry-on included.\n- **Cebu to Siargao** (CEB to IAO, direct, about 1h): PHP 3,650. Midday departure, 20 kg checked bag included.\n- **Manila to Siargao** (MNL to IAO, direct, about 1h 45m): PHP 4,890. Early morning departure, 7 kg carry-on included.\n- **Clark to Siargao** (CRK to IAO, direct, about 1h 55m): PHP 5,420. Morning departure, skips Manila traffic.\n- **Manila to Siargao** (MNL to IAO, direct, about 1h 50m): PHP 6,750. Late morning departure, 20 kg checked bag included.\n\n**What the PHP 4,890 Manila fare includes (sample)**\n- Base fare: PHP 3,290\n- Fuel surcharge: PHP 620\n- Taxes and airport fees: PHP 680\n- Booking and service fees: PHP 300\n\n**Heads up:** promo fares usually include only a 7 kg carry-on. Add checked bags or a surfboard when you book: it costs far less online than at the airport counter.\n\nFrom Sayak Airport it is about 1 hour by shared van to General Luna.",
